{"type":"message","id":"0e4b1cf3","parentId":"77602560","timestamp":"2026-04-15T09:01:08.326Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GitHub安装似乎有问题，可能网络访问不到GitHub。让我尝试另一种方法 - 使用pip安装从GitHub的tarball。\n\n实际上，既然搜索结果显示omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper是pip可安装的，但直接安装失败，可能是因为这个包名不对。让我去查看正确的包名。\n\n根据GitHub页面，包可能叫 `alibaba-scraper` 或者需要特殊安装。让我尝试用Python脚本直接实现类似功能，或者使用其他替代方案。\n\n同时，浏览器问题 - OpenClaw配置中已经有browser配置且Chrome路径正确。让我研究一下为什么浏览器连接失败。\n\n根据之前的错误，浏览器timeout了。这可能是因为：\n1. Chrome需要特殊权限或配置\n2. Chrome remote debugging端口没有正确配置\n3. 需要以特定方式启动Chrome\n\n让我尝试直接启动Chrome的remote debugging模式，然后连接。"},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub访问有问题。让我换一种方式 - 先研究浏览器问题，然后实现一个简单的1688搜索方案：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n2k9bxsfjl8q_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"google-chrome --version 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n2k9bxsfjl8q_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 尝试启动Chrome remote debugging模式\ngoogle-chrome --remote-debugging-port=9222 --no-sandbox --headless --disable-gpu 2>&1 &\nsleep 2\ncurl -s http://localhost:9222/json/version 2>&1 | head -5","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776243658539,"responseId":"062e86cab2f314844a664c65e0f22a49"}}
