{"type":"message","id":"6ab04442","parentId":"c014e0bb","timestamp":"2026-04-15T09:03:13.697Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The browser is still failing to start. The issue seems to be that even though Chrome is running on port 18800, OpenClaw can't connect to it via CDP. The `cdpReady: false` suggests the CDP handshake isn't working.\n\nLet me try a different approach. Let me write a simple Python script that can search 1688 using requests + BeautifulSoup, since we have those libraries already installed. This will be a workaround until we get the browser working.\n\nActually, let me try to use Playwright or Selenium since those might be available or easier to install."},{"type":"text","text":"浏览器连接还是有问题。让我换个思路 — 直接用Python写一个1688搜索脚本（requests+BeautifulSoup已安装）：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_q99iacnriow4_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip3 list 2>/dev/null | grep -iE \"playwright|selenium|httpx|aiohttp\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_q99iacnriow4_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"import requests; print('requests OK:', requests.__version__)\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776243786815,"responseId":"062e874ac7e1f78dd80e1b0e8ead4d7f"}}
