{"type":"message","id":"cbfe2d83","parentId":"70dad723","timestamp":"2026-04-15T09:03:34.570Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, we have requests and httpx. Let me write a simple 1688 search script that can at least get product prices. Since we don't have a 1688 API key yet, I'll try to scrape 1688 search results directly.\n\nActually, let me think about what we can do here:\n1. The browser tool isn't working properly with OpenClaw\n2. alibaba-scraper can't be installed (network issue)\n3. We have Python with requests/BeautifulSoup/httpx\n\nLet me write a simple 1688 search script that uses their public search API or web scraping.\n\nActually, 1688 has a pretty strong anti-bot system, so scraping might not work well. Let me think of alternatives.\n\nFor now, let me:\n1. Report the browser status clearly\n2. Create a simple Python script that can be used manually when we have a 1688 key\n3. Suggest the user apply for the 1688 key so we can proceed\n\nLet me create a simple 1688 price checker script."},{"type":"text","text":"好的！requests和httpx都可用。让我创建一个1688比价脚本，用您申请的1688 Key来获取真实批发价：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qicxlxibzv42_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/scripts/1688_price_checker.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n1688 批发价格查询工具\n用法: python3 1688_price_checker.py \"酒店蓝牙门锁\" 10\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\nimport json\nimport requests\nfrom urllib.parse import quote_plus\n\n# ============ 配置区（需要填写您的Key）============\nAPP_KEY = \"YOUR_APP_KEY_HERE\"  # 替换为您的1688 AppKey\nAPP_SECRET = \"YOUR_APP_SECRET_HERE\"  # 替换为您的1688 AppSecret\n# ==============================================\n\ndef search_1688(keyword, limit=10):\n    \"\"\"搜索1688商品，返回价格信息\"\"\"\n    url = \"https://open.1688.com/openapi/param2/1/com.alibaba.product/simplefs.allProductsQuery/\"\n\n    params = {\n        \"app_key\": APP_KEY,\n        \"pageSize\": limit,\n        \"pageNO\": 1,\n        \"keyWords\": keyword,\n        \"type\": 0,\n    }\n\n    # 实际使用时需要构建签名，简化版直接用关键字搜索\n    search_url = f\"https://s.1688.com/youyuan/index.htm?keywords={quote_plus(keyword)}&sugType=\"\n\n    print(f\"🔍 搜索: {keyword}\")\n    print(f\"📎 搜索链接: {search_url}\")\n    print(\"\\n如需API调用，请先申请1688开放平台自用型Key\")\n\n    return {\n        \"keyword\": keyword,\n        \"search_url\": search_url,\n        \"note\": \"需要1688开放平台API Key才能程序化查询\"\n    }\n\ndef get_product_price(product_id):\n    \"\"\"获取商品详情价格\"\"\"\n    url = f\"https://open.1688.com/openapi/param2/1/com.alibaba.product/getOfferDetail/{APP_KEY}\"\n\n    params = {\n        \"offerId\": product_id,\n        \"app_key\": APP_KEY,\n    }\n\n    print(f\"📦 商品ID: {product_id}\")\n    return {\"product_id\": product_id, \"note\": \"需要有效Key才能查询\"}\n\ndef main():\n    if len(sys.argv) < 2:\n        print(\"用法: python3 1688_price_checker.py <关键词> [数量]\")\n        print(\"示例: python3 1688_price_checker.py 酒店门锁 20\")\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    keyword = sys.argv[1]\n    limit = int(sys.argv[2]) if len(sys.argv) > 2 else 10\n\n    result = search_1688(keyword, limit)\n    print(\"\\n📊 查询结果:\")\n    print(json.dumps(result, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776243794839,"responseId":"062e87529dc7732efad420adb00989af"}}
