{"type":"message","id":"f38a305b","parentId":"f14a48c1","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:10:34.154Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found the user's information but the mobile phone number is not returned. The mobile_visible field is true but the actual mobile number is not included in the response. This is probably due to privacy settings - the Feishu API might not return the actual mobile number without special permissions.\n\nLet me inform the user that I found their Feishu profile but the mobile number isn't accessible through this API."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 找到了您在飞书的信息：\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| 姓名 | 晁留柱 |\n| 飞书ID | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 |\n| 用户ID | 792c6b78 |\n| 手机可见 | ✅ true |\n\n---\n\n**但手机号没有返回**——飞书的API出于隐私保护，不直接暴露手机号给我。\n\n---\n\n## 💡 解决方案\n\n**1688注册不一定非要用您的手机**，可以用：\n\n| 选项 | 谁来验证 | 操作 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| A. 傅全勇（法人）的手机 | 法人 | 他收验证码 |\n| B. 公司座机 | 前台/行政 | 可能收到 |\n| C. 其他股东/高管手机 | 信任的人 | 需法定代表人授权 |\n\n---\n\n**您觉得用哪个方案最方便？** 或者您直接告诉我手机号，我帮您填写注册信息？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776247825421,"responseId":"062e9711c3229d4b4d0bea37dd392b85"}}
