{"type":"message","id":"44d80ef5","parentId":"e8621b55","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:11:39.478Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found the registration steps. Let me now guide the user through the 1688 registration process manually. The key steps are:\n\n1. Go to 1688 registration page\n2. Upload business license photo\n3. Fill in the credit code, company name, legal person info\n4. Choose verification method (Alipay or bank account)\n\nSince the browser keeps getting blocked, let me provide clear instructions for the user to do the registration themselves, but I'll have all the information ready so I can guide them step by step.\n\nActually, the key issue is that I can't access the 1688 registration page due to anti-bot protection. Let me think of another approach.\n\nActually, 1688 has a specific registration flow:\n1. First you need to upload the business license\n2. Then it auto-fills company info from the credit code\n3. Then verify via Alipay or bank account\n\nSince the browser approach isn't working, maybe I should just guide the user through the process with me reading out the steps, and they do the actual clicking.\n\nOr maybe I should ask if they can do it on their phone since the 1688 app might have a simpler flow.\n\nLet me provide a clear guide for them to follow, with me reading each step aloud."},{"type":"text","text":"明白了！1688注册页面我访问一直被拦截，但我可以一步一步引导您操作。\n\n---\n\n## 📝 1688企业注册 - 一步步跟我做\n\n### 第一步：进入注册页面\n\n在**手机或电脑**浏览器打开：\n```\nhttps://reg.1688.com/register/enterprise/index.html\n```\n\n或者直接百度搜索「**1688企业注册**」\n\n---\n\n### 第二步：选择「企业注册」\n\n点击「企业注册」→「上传营业执照」\n\n---\n\n### 第三步：上传营业执照\n\n点击上传清晰的营业执照**正本照片**（您刚才发给我的那张）\n\n---\n\n### 第四步：确认自动填充的信息\n\n上传后，系统会自动识别并填充：\n- ✅ 企业名称：**天津瑞湾开元酒店管理有限公司**\n- ✅ 统一社会信用代码：**91120116058726816P**\n- ✅ 法定代表人：**李东林**\n\n**请确认这些信息是否正确！**\n\n---\n\n### 第五步：验证方式选择\n\n1688提供两种认证方式：\n\n| 方式 | 操作 | 难度 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **支付宝认证**（推荐） | 用已实名认证的企业支付宝扫码 | ⭐简单 |\n| **对公账户认证** | 1688往对公账户打一笔钱，你确认金额 | ⭐⭐复杂 |\n\n---\n\n**您现在可以开始操作吗？做到了哪一步告诉我，我来帮您确认信息！**\n\n或者如果您觉得麻烦，也可以先跳过注册，我用其他方式帮您做采购调研。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776247881635,"responseId":"062e9749f673ca8a9dcbdb5d3d103fc4"}}
