{"type":"message","id":"85c0be6a","parentId":"9ecb6617","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:38:19.446Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking two very sharp questions:\n\n1. Regarding the agricultural product price skill I mentioned earlier - how can I avoid hardcoding prices? For example, a hotel in the south might care more about real-time prices from nearby agricultural markets.\n\n2. Regarding the salmon unlock case I mentioned earlier - how did I get the prices from Taobao/JD? Are they real?\n\nThese are excellent questions that get to the heart of data quality and methodology. Let me think through this carefully.\n\nFirst, I need to recall what \"agricultural product price skill\" and \"salmon unlock case\" the user is referring to. Looking at the conversation context, I haven't actually discussed a specific \"agricultural product price skill\" in this conversation. The user might be referring to something discussed elsewhere, or they might be testing my understanding.\n\nActually, re-reading the user's message - they're saying \"按照你刚刚在群里回应的农产品的价格skill\" which translates to \"according to the agricultural product price skill you just responded to in the group\". This might be referring to a different conversation or a different session.\n\nWait, I think the user might be conflating different conversations or is confused about what I said. In this current conversation, I've been discussing:\n- 1688 API access\n- Hotel employee roster\n- Product research for hotel supplies (door locks, mineral water, tissues, drinks)\n\nI haven't discussed an \"agricultural product price skill\" specifically. The user might be:\n1. Referring to something from another chat/group\n2. Hypothetically asking about what such a skill would look like\n3. Testing my consistency\n\nAs for the salmon case - I also don't recall discussing a salmon price case in this conversation. The user might be referring to a separate conversation.\n\nGiven the context, I think the most honest answer is to:\n1. Clarify what I actually discussed in this conversation\n2. Address the underlying questions about methodology\n\nThe user's underlying questions are very valid:\n- How would an agricultural price skill avoid hardcoding?\n- How would it adapt to regional differences (southern vs northern hotels)?\n\n\n- In the salmon case, how did I get Taobao/JD prices - were they real?\n\nI should be honest that I'm not sure which specific cases the user is referring to, but I can address their underlying methodological concerns about how such a system would work in practice. For regional price adaptation, the skill would need access to location-specific data sources and avoid static price lists. For the e-commerce prices, I should clarify whether those came from live API calls or were illustrative examples."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 您问得很好，这两个问题都问到了关键点！\n\n---\n\n## 问题一：农产品价格Skill如何避免硬编码？\n\n**坦白说**：我没有在当前对话中讨论过\"农产品价格Skill\"，您可能是在其他群/对话中看到的。\n\n但您的担忧非常正确——**真正有价值的农产品价格Skill应该**：\n\n### ❌ 错误做法（硬编码）\n```\n土豆价格 = 2.5元/斤  # 这种是硬编码，无法适应地域差异\n```\n\n### ✅ 正确做法（数据驱动）\n\n```python\n# 思路1：按城市/区域查询实时价格\nasync def get_agri_price(city: str, product: str):\n    \"\"\"根据酒店所在城市，查询当地批发市场实时价\"\"\"\n    market_api = {\n        \"天津\": \"天津红旗农贸市场API\",\n        \"上海\": \"上海江桥批发市场API\", \n        \"广州\": \"广州江南果菜批发市场API\"\n    }\n    return await query_market(market_api[city], product)\n\n# 思路2：对接农业农村部等官方数据源\n# https://www.agri.cn/price/ 全国各地农产品批发价格日报\n\n# 思路3：对接一亩田、惠农网等B2B平台API\n```\n\n### 地域适配示例\n\n| 酒店位置 | 关注的市场 | 数据来源 |\n|---------|-----------|---------|\n| 天津瑞湾 | 红旗农贸批发市场 | 天津市场实时数据 |\n| 南方酒店 | 当地批发市场 | 按城市动态匹配 |\n| 内蒙古酒店 | 呼伦贝尔农贸市场 | 北方市场数据 |\n\n---\n\n## 问题二：三文鱼案例中淘宝/京东价格怎么取得的？\n\n**坦白说**：我需要诚实面对这个问题。\n\n在当前对话中，**我没有实际获取过淘宝/京东的三文鱼价格**。之前给您展示的门锁、矿泉水价格，是通过 `web_search` 工具搜索到的**搜索结果摘要**，这些价格：\n\n### ❌ 不是实时的\n- 搜索结果可能来自缓存\n- 价格可能已过时\n- 无法验证是否为最新价\n\n### ❌ 不是完整数据\n- 饮料只显示了单瓶价，没有整箱价\n- 显示\"¥12-20/瓶\"是价格区间，不是精确价\n- 无法保证数据准确性\n\n### ✅ 真正可靠的方式\n\n| 方式 | 真实性 | 实现难度 |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| 1688官方API | ✅ 真实 | 需要申请Key |\n| 超市/菜市场价格API | ✅ 真实 | 需要对接数据源 |\n| 人工采集 | ✅ 真实 | 费时费力 |\n| 搜索引擎摘要 | ❌ 不确定 | 我目前能做的 |\n\n---\n\n## 核心问题\n\n**我的 web_search 工具拿到的是「搜索引擎摘要」，不是真实电商数据。**\n\n这意味着：\n- 价格可能不准确\n- 数据可能滞后\n- 无法用于正式的比价决策\n\n**要想获得真实数据，必须走官方API或人工采集。**\n\n---\n\n## 💡 您希望我怎么做？\n\n**选项A**：继续用搜索引擎做初步调研（快但不准确，适合摸底）\n\n**选项B**：等1688账号注册好，用API查真实数据（慢但准确）\n\n**选项C**：找可以接通的农产品/超市实时价格API（需要研究数据源）\n\n您倾向哪个？或者您有其他想法？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776249466822,"responseId":"062e9d7affe482e016dfd0af68df6208"}}
{"type":"message","id":"303c196f","parentId":"85c0be6a","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:40:48.988Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-15 10:40:47 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b52c2fc2b5908c441302f8a83b1f]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52c2fc2b5908c441302f8a83b1f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-15 10:40 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n搜索引擎做调研是指的用网络搜索获得的价格吧"}],"timestamp":1776249648934}}
{"type":"message","id":"050afcec","parentId":"303c196f","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:41:01.137Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is confirming that \"搜索引擎做调研\" means using web search to get prices. They're asking for clarification. I should confirm this and explain what web_search actually does and its limitations."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 是的，没错。\n\n**搜索引擎调研** = 用 `web_search` 工具搜索，然后我从搜索结果摘要里提取价格信息。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 搜索引擎调研的工作流程\n\n```\n我调用 web_search(\"三文鱼 批发价格\")\n        ↓\n搜索结果返回一堆网页摘要\n        ↓\n我从摘要里提取价格信息\n        ↓\n整理成表格给您\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 局限性（您需要知道的）\n\n| 优点 | 缺点 |\n|------|------|\n| 快（几秒钟出结果） | 数据可能来自旧页面/缓存 |\n| 无需注册/申请 | 1688反爬虫，无法直接访问 |\n| 覆盖面广 | 价格区间模糊（如\"¥20-30\"） |\n| 免费 | 无法保证准确性 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 举例说明\n\n**我搜索\"三文鱼 批发价格\"** → 搜索结果可能返回：\n\n```\n来源：京东商城\n三文鱼刺身 100g装 ¥35.9 → 这是零售价，不是批发价\n\n来源：1688\n挪威三文鱼 整箱约10kg ¥400-500 → 这是起订价区间，不是实时价\n```\n\n**问题**：我不知道这是什么时候的价格，也不知道页面是否更新过。\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 所以\n\n- **初步摸底** → 可以用搜索引擎（知道大概价格范围）\n- **正式比价** → 需要1688 API或人工确认\n\n**您现在想让我用搜索引擎给您搜哪个品类的初步价格？** 还是等1688账号下来用API查更准的数据？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776249648988,"responseId":"062e9e31c127c68733b93addb5f95f6d"}}
