{"type":"message","id":"bb3b3568","parentId":"0eedce0f","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:44:20.468Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_5ov6himu2i2q_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"free product price API scraper GitHub open source 2024 2025\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"price-scraper\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/topics/price-scraper\",\n      \"description\": \"#\\nprice-scraper\\nHere are 26 public repositories matching this topic...\\noxylabs / amazon-scraper\\nFree Trial Amazon Scraper API for extracting search, product, offer listing, reviews, question and answers, best sellers and sellers data.\\npython\\nweb-scraping\\nprice-scraper\\ne-commerce-api\\namazon-scraper\\nscraping-api\\namazon-price-tracker\\namazon-scraping-library\\namazon-scrap...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - Pangolin-spg/amazon-scrape-api: Powerful E-commerce Scraping API for Amazon, Walmart, Shopify, eBay & more. Auto-adapts to page changes. Get product data in JSON/HTML/Markdown. 200 free API c\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Pangolin-spg/amazon-scrape-api\",\n      \"description\": \"Pangolin-spg</td></tr>\\n</table>\\nREADME\\n✨ Why Pangolin?\\nTraditional web scrapers break when websites update their HTML structure. Pangolin adapts automatically.\\n✅ Zero Maintenance — Our AI detects page changes and updates parsers automatically\\n✅ 99.9% Uptime — Enterprise-grade infrastructure with automatic retry logic\\n✅ No Proxies Needed — Built-in anti-bot bypass (CAPTCHA, rate limits, fingerprinting)...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - capturr/scraper: All In One API to easily scrape data from any website, without worrying about captchas and bot detection mecanisms. · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/scrapingapi/scraper\",\n      \"description\": \"One powerful API to scrape all the web\\nEasily scrape data from any website, without worrying about captchas and bot detection mecanisms.\\nFeatures\\nNo captcha, no bot detection. Websites will see you as a human.\\nIntegrated data extraction:\\nEasily extract data with CSS / jQuery-like selectors\\nUse filters to get ultra-clean data: url, price, ...\\nIterate through items (ex: search results, products list, articles, ...)\\nBulk requests...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Price Scraping Toolkit\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/HasData/ecommerce-price-scraper\",\n      \"description\": \"Price Scraping Toolkit\\nA production-grade collection of Python scripts for extracting, normalizing, and monitoring e-commerce pricing data.\\nFeatures\\nMulti-locale price normalization (US/EU formats)\\nMarketing noise removal (\\\"Was $X\\\", \\\"Save Y%\\\")\\nCurrency detection with geo-context\\nHierarchical selector strategies (JSON-LD → microdata → CSS)\\nAPI interception via Playwright\\nAI-powered extraction for complex layouts\\nPrice drop monitoring with SQLite\\nProject Structure\\n<...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"product-scraper 0.1.4\",\n      \"url\": \"https://pypi.org/project/product-scraper/\",\n      \"description\": \"Product Scraper is a Python library designed to extract structured product data from e-commerce websites. Instead of relying on fragile CSS selectors or hard-coded XPaths, it learns how products look on a page—mimicking how a human identifies a title, price, or image.\\n🧠 Machine Learning Driven: Uses a Random Forest classifier to identify product elements based on visual, textual, and structural features.\\n🖱️ Interactive Training: Includes a browser-based UI (power...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"amazon-product-scraper\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/topics/amazon-product-scraper\",\n      \"description\": \"#\\namazon-product-scraper\\nHere are 23 public repositories matching this topic...\\noxylabs / amazon-scraper\\nFree Trial Amazon Scraper API for extracting search, product, offer listing, reviews, question and answers, best sellers and sellers data.\\npython\\nweb-scraping\\nprice-scraper\\ne-commerce-api\\namazon-scraper\\nscraping-api\\namazon-price-tracker\\namazon-scraping-library\\namazon...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Veepee Product Item Scraper\",\n      \"url\": \"https://apify.com/saswave/veepee-product-item-scraper/api\",\n      \"description\": \"Veepee Product Item Scraper\\nsaswave/veepee-product-item-scraper\\nFrench ecommerce website veepee.fr scraper. Extract product item informations from search results. Collect price, retail price, quantity, name, brand and more. At scale. Boost your competition monitoring and analytics activities.\\nPricing\\nfrom $2.00 / 1,000 results\\nDeveloper\\nYou can access the Veepee Product Item Scraper programmatically from your...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"PriceRunner Product Offers Scraper\",\n      \"url\": \"https://apify.com/m3web/pricerunner-product-offers-scraper/api/python\",\n      \"description\": \"PriceRunner Product Offers Scraper\\nPricing $1.50 / 1,000 results\\nPriceRunner Product Offers Scraper\\nm3web/pricerunner...\\n\\nYou can access the PriceRunner Product Offers Scraper programmatically from your own applications by using the Apify API. You can also choose the language preference from below. To use the Apify API, you’ll need an Apify account and your API token, found in Integrations settings in Apify Console.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"2025 年最值得推荐的 17 款网页爬虫工具 | Thunderbit\",\n      \"url\": \"https://thunderbit.com/zh-Hans/blog/top-website-scraping-tools\",\n      \"description\": \"2025 年最值得推荐的 17 款网页爬虫工具\\n最后更新于 June 18, 2025\\n作者 Shuai Guan\\n说实话，到了 2025 年，互联网早就不只是刷猫咪表情包和发朋友圈的地方了——它已经变成