{"type":"message","id":"6ce9f026","parentId":"bb3b3568","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:44:20.702Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_5ov6himu2i2q_2","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"price comparison API free tier developer tools scrapin\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"14 Best Web Scraping APIs in 2026 for Developers\",\n      \"url\": \"https://geekflare.com/guides/best-web-scraping-apis/\",\n      \"description\": \"Scraperless is a customizable cloud-based browser built on its own Chromium engine for web crawlers and AI agents. Its scraping API adapts in real time to website blockers. Scraperless dynamically adjusts fingerprinting parameters and...\\nWhat is the cheapest web scraping API?\\nGeekflare API is the cheapest web scraping API, with plans starting at $9/month.\\nCan I scrape without coding?\\nYes, you can use the Geekflare API playground to perform basic scraping tasks. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Product Item Search & Price Comparison\",\n      \"url\": \"https://rapidapi.com/syazvinski/api/product-item-search-price-comparison/details\",\n      \"description\": \"API Overview\\nOur Product Item Search Price Comparison API is a fast, reliable, and budget-friendly tool designed to make your product search process more efficient. This dynamic API supports real-time retrieval of price details, drawing from a wide variety of sources to ensure the most thorough results. Discover the value of complete market visibility with our Product Item Search Price Comparison API.\\nFast, reliable API for cheap, thorough product search, and price comparisons.\\nProduct Search API Documentation\\nEndpoints\\n/product_search\\n...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Scrappey vs\",\n      \"url\": \"https://scrappey.com/alternatives/scrapingbee\",\n      \"description\": \"What makes