{"type":"message","id":"d0b447b0","parentId":"6ce9f026","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:44:20.757Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_5ov6himu2i2q_3","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"Puppeteer Playwright price scraping real time price free\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"8 Best Scrape Google Search Prices in 2025 (Updated)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.scrapediary.com/scrape-google-search-prices/\",\n      \"description\": \"Pricing: Playwright is completely free and open-source. The only costs involved are for the computing resources needed to run it, which can be as low as $5 per month for a basic VPS.\\nKey features:\\nAuto-wait functionality that ensures elements are ready before interacting\\nBuilt-in support for multiple browser contexts and incognito sessions\\nPowerful selectors API for easy element targeting\\nAutomatic handling of browser events and network requests\\nCross-platform compatibility on Windows, macOS, and...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Playwright Pricing Calculator 2026\",\n      \"url\": \"https://costbench.com/software/browser-testing/playwright/calculator/\",\n      \"description\": \"Playwright Pricing Calculator 2026\\nEstimate your total cost including hidden fees\\nThe Playwright pricing calculator at CostBench estimates true total...\\nPlaywright pricing ranges from $0 to $0 per month as of April 2026. Playwright offers 2 pricing tiers. Implementation, training, and support fees can add 30-60% to the base license fee. Pricing verified from 2 sources by CostBench.\\nAll Playwright tiers require custom pricing\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Playwright 网页爬虫新手入门指南\",\n      \"url\": \"https://thunderbit.com/zh-Hans/blog/playwright-python-tutorial\",\n      \"description\": \"轻松搞定 JavaScript 动态网站：特别适合抓取 eBay 这类电商巨头，产品数据都是动态加载的。\\n自动化用户操作：比如点击“下一页”、滚动页面、筛选、登录等，完全模拟真人操作。\\n支持无头模式：不用打开浏览器窗口，后台静默运行，效率更高。\\n智能等待机制：自动等内容加载完再抓取，减少出错和数据丢失（详细说明）。\\n\\n<tr><th>对比项</th><th>...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How to Use AnyCrawl for Scraping Prices from Websites\",\n      \"url\": \"https://anycrawl.dev/blogs/how-to-scrape-prices-from-websites\",\n      \"description\": \"| Engine | Best for | Speed | Cost | | -------------- | ------------------------ | ------- | ------ | | Cheerio | Static HTML pages | Fastest | Lowest | | Playwright | JavaScript-heavy sites | Medium | Medium | | Puppeteer | Chrome-specific needs | Medium | Medium |\\nMost e-commerce sites these days use JavaScript to render prices, so you'll usually want Playwright. But if you're scraping a simple static site, Cheerio is faster and cheaper...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Build a Price Tracker with Playwright: Monitor Amazon, BestBuy, and Any Retailer\",\n      \"url\": \"https://30tools.com/blogs/opspawn/build-a-price-tracker-with-playwright-monitor-amazon-bestbuy-and-any-retailer-2eg4\",\n      \"description\": \"#playwright\\n#typescript\\n#webscraping\\n#node\\nBuild a Price Tracker with Playwright: Monitor Amazon, BestBuy, and Any Retailer\\nOpSpawn\\nMarch 7, 2026\\nBuilding a price tracker with Playwright is straightforward once you have the right primitives. Here's everything you need.\\nThe Core Loop\\ninterface PriceAlert {\\n  url: string;\\n  selector: string;\\n  targetPrice: number;...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Puppeteer Scraper\",\n      \"url\": \"https://digitalbiztalk.com/tools/apify-actors/apify/puppeteer-scraper\",\n      \"description\": \"## Cost of usage You can find the average usage cost for this Actor on the pricing page under the <beginning of the code>Which plan do I need?<end of the code...\\nCheerio Scraper is equivalent to <beginning of the code>Simple HTML pages<end of the code> while Web Scraper, Puppeteer Scraper and Playwright Scraper are equivalent to <beginning of the code>Full web pages<end of the code>. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Puppeteer Setup Guide\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/eltonaguiar/TORONTOEVENTS_ANTIGRAVITY/blob/main/PUPPETEER_SETUP.md\",\n      \"description\": \"Price extraction success rate remains < 60% after enhanced patterns\\nMany events load prices via JavaScript\\nStatic scraping consistently fails for specific sources\\nDon't use Puppeteer if:\\nStatic scraping works well (> 70% success rate)\\nSpeed is critical\\nRunning in resource-constrained environments\\nInstallation\\nnpm install puppeteer\\nSuccess Rate: 70-85% (with enhanced patterns)\\nPuppeteer Scraping:\\nSpeed: ~2-...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Best way to add real-time content analysis to puppeteer scrapers?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://community.latenode.com/t/best-way-to-add-real-time-content-analysis-to-puppeteer-scrapers/42654\",\n      \"description\": \"Any solutions that integrate content analysis directly into browser automation workflows? Bonus if it can make scraping decisions based...\\nI process 10k product pages daily with real-time price/feature extraction.\\nQuantumSage\\nSeptember 16, 2025, 5:38pm\\nArchitecturally, you want inline processing to avoid double-handling data. Look for platforms offering serverless AI functions that trigger immediately after data capture. Ensure they support retry mechanisms for API limits. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - gokborayilmaz/browseruse-price-tracker-agent: BrowserUse-Price-Tracker-Agent is a powerful AI-powered price tracker that scrapes multiple e-commerce websites for product prices using BrowserU\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/gokborayilmaz/browseruse-price-tracker-agent\",\n      \"description\": \"This agent displays the best deals in a user...\\nInstall <beginning of the code>browser-use<end of the code> and <beginning of the code>playwright<end of the code>\\nBrowserUse requires Playwright for web scraping capabilities. Run the following commands:\\npip install browser-use\\nplaywright install\\nRunning the Application\\nStart the FastAPI Server\\nupsonicai:app --reload\\nOpen the UI\\nGo to http://127.0.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How to Scrape Like a Pro with Puppeteer in 2026\",\n      \"url\": \"https://toxigon.com/advanced-puppeteer-techniques-for-web-scraping\",\n      \"description\": \"Comparison With Newer Tools\\nPlaywright has gained popularity since its 2020 release, and it's a fantastic...\\nFeature Puppeteer Playwright Browser Support Chromium only (with Firefox experimental) Chromium, Firefox, WebKit API Stability Very stable (backward compatible) Still evolving (breaking changes) JavaScript Execution Full access to page context Similar but slightly different API Performance Slightly faster for Chromium More consistent across browsers Community & Docs Massive community, great docs Growing but smaller community\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"Puppeteer Playwright price scraping real time price free","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"8 Best Scrape Google Search Prices in 2025 (Updated)","url":"https://www.scrapediary.com/scrape-google-search-prices/","description":"Pricing: Playwright is completely free and open-source. The only costs involved are for the computing resources needed to run it, which can be as low as $5 per month for a basic VPS.\nKey features:\nAuto-wait functionality that ensures elements are ready before interacting\nBuilt-in support for multiple browser contexts and incognito sessions\nPowerful selectors API for easy element targeting\nAutomatic handling of browser events and network requests\nCross-platform compatibility on Windows, macOS, and...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Playwright Pricing Calculator 2026"