erUse-Price-Tracker-Agent is a powerful AI-powered price tracker that scrapes multiple e-commerce websites for product prices using BrowserU","url":"https://github.com/gokborayilmaz/browseruse-price-tracker-agent","description":"This agent displays the best deals in a user...\nInstall <beginning of the code>browser-use<end of the code> and <beginning of the code>playwright<end of the code>\nBrowserUse requires Playwright for web scraping capabilities. Run the following commands:\npip install browser-use\nplaywright install\nRunning the Application\nStart the FastAPI Server\nupsonicai:app --reload\nOpen the UI\nGo to http://127.0.","siteName":""},{"title":"How to Scrape Like a Pro with Puppeteer in 2026","url":"https://toxigon.com/advanced-puppeteer-techniques-for-web-scraping","description":"Comparison With Newer Tools\nPlaywright has gained popularity since its 2020 release, and it's a fantastic...\nFeature Puppeteer Playwright Browser Support Chromium only (with Firefox experimental) Chromium, Firefox, WebKit API Stability Very stable (backward compatible) Still evolving (breaking changes) JavaScript Execution Full access to page context Similar but slightly different API Performance Slightly faster for Chromium More consistent across browsers Community & Docs Massive community, great docs Growing but smaller community\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776249860702}}
