{"type":"message","id":"006efc02","parentId":"9fcc56d0","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:44:30.724Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_kigamimo1it6_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"supermarket API grocery price data free developer China\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Kroger\",\n      \"url\": \"https://publicapis.io/kroger-api\",\n      \"description\": \"const data = await response.json();\\nconsole.log(data);\\n<end of the code>\\nThe Supermarket Data API offers powerful capabilities for accessing detailed product information, store details, and pricing data from Kroger’s extensive supermarket network. This API is designed to enhance your applications by providing seamless access to real-time data, enabling businesses to create personalized shopping experiences, implement loyalty programs, and optimize inventory management. Access to comprehensive product and pricing information from Kroger stores.\\nAbility to enhance...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Top Grocery Store APIs\",\n      \"url\": \"https://rapidapi.com/collection/grocery\",\n      \"description\": \"Many foods and nutrition APIs such as the Edamam API list information that is publicly available, so they offer access at no charge or have a freemium package for applications that make less frequent requests. Because grocery delivery APIs often have private client information, they may not be publicly available or will require a charge for use.\\nBest Grocery Store APIs\\nThere are many [food and recipe APIs](https://rapidapi.These are used mostly to exchange price and product information with Price Comparison...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Publix API\",\n      \"url\": \"https://apify.com/ideas/publix-api-79b5363e\",\n      \"description\": \"Publix API\\nBuild an Actor\\nStatus\\nOpen to develop\\nCategories\\nAutomation\\nE-commerce\\nMarketing\\nOctober 22, 2025\\nAccess Publix supermarket data effortlessly with the Publix API Actor. This tool automates the extraction of product information, pricing, store locations, and availability details from Publix's online platform, transforming it into structured, API-accessible formats.\\nKey features\\nReal-time price monitoring: Track product prices across multiple store locations....\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Top 10 Grocery Store APIs to Use in 2025\",\n      \"url\": \"https://datarade.ai/top-lists/best-grocery-store-apis\",\n      \"description\": \"The API provides real-time access to pricing data from major grocery and retail chains including Walmart, Target, Costco, Kroger, Safeway, Whole Foods, Aldi, and many more. Users can leverage this data to track competitor prices, analyze geographic pricing trends, and optimize their own pricing strategies. With historical data available for up to one year and customizable delivery formats (.bin, .json, .xml, .csv, .xls, .sql, .txt), businesses can gain meaningful insights...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data Scraping API - BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data Insights API\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.productdatascrape.com/boothssupermarket-grocery-data-scraping-api.php\",\n      \"description\": \"BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data Scraping API - BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data Insights API\\nLeverage our powerful BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data...\\nPricing Insights\\nInventory Shift\\nConsumer Purchase Trends\\nStock Mapping\\nDemand Forecasting\\nThe BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data Scraping API provides valuable hyperlocal pricing data across various regions. Businesses using Web Scraping BoothsSupermarket APIs can track city-wise pricing variations, identify target markets, and adjust competitive pricing. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"supermarket-api\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/davidlick/supermarket-api\",\n      \"description\": \"Latest commit\\nGit stats\\nFiles\\nType\\nName\\ncmd/api\\nsupermarket-api\\nSupermarket-API is a service providing functionality for cataloging produce and their prices.\\nGetting Started\\nTo start <beginning of the code>\\n supermarket-api\\n<end of the code>\\nyou will need to create an .env file at <beginning of the code>\\n cmd/api/.env\\n<tr><th> Method</th><th> Endpoint</th><th>...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"iGrosa API\",\n      \"url\": \"https://rapidapi.com/Blssngx/api/igrosa-api\",\n      \"description\": \"iGrosa API\\nFree\\n0.1 Popularity\\n100% Service Level\\n513ms Latency\\nN/A Test\\nAPI Overview\\niGrosa API is a groundbreaking solution that revolutionizes the way businesses and developers access grocery prices from multiple supermarkets. iGrosa API streamlines access to extensive product catalogs, ensuring up-to-date pricing information for an enhanced shopping experience. Unlock the power of grocery price intelligence with iGrosa API and gain a competitive...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Best Dmart APIs | Zyla API Hub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://zylalabs.com/api-marketplace/top-search/Dmart\",\n      \"description\": \"Mercado Libre Data Fetcher API\\nEffortlessly access and retrieve real-time data from Mercado Libre for your applications.\\nCommerce & eCommerce\\nFree 7-day Trial\\nService Level:\\n100%\\n...\\n\\nWalmart Data API\\nGet price, title, description, images, search products, reviews and ratings and much more inform...\\nCommerce & eCommerce\\nFree 7-day Trial\\nService Level:\\n100%\\nResponse Time:\\n9,066ms\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Supermarket-connector\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Repsay/supermarket-mobile-api-connector/\",\n      \"description\": \"This api-client allows you to access all data find within the mobile api of the supermarket. This can be used to check prices, promotions or for instance alergies.\\nInstalling\\nSupermarket-connector is available on PyPI:\\npython -m pip install supermarket-connector\\nSupermarket-connector is build for python 3.9+.\\nCurrent supermarkets connected\\nCurrently it is not possible to connect to Lidl supermarket data due to the fact that they do not have a public api...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Grocery Data Scraper API\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.scrapingbee.com/scrapers/grocery-data-api/\",\n      \"description\": \"Scrape price trends\\nMonitor real-time grocery store product price changes and trends across competitors and marketplaces, react faster to pricing shifts, discounts, and demand signals.\\nTrack expiration dates\\nAutomate expiration tracking to prevent spoilage, optimize stock, and reduce waste, enhancing operational efficiency.\\nTransparent Grocery...\\n\\nSTEP 3\\nUse your Grocery Data API key to fetch any detail programmatically. We do all the heavy lifting, you get ready-to-use, rendered HTML for parsing and analysis.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"supermarket API grocery price data free developer China","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"Kroger","url":"https://publicapis.io/kroger-api","description":"const data = await response.json();\nconsole.log(data);\n<end of the code>\nThe Supermarket Data API offers powerful capabilities for accessing detailed product information, store details, and pricing data from Kroger’s extensive supermarket network. This API is designed to enhance your applications by providing seamless access to real-time data, enabling businesses to create personalized shopping experiences, implement loyalty programs, and optimize inventory management. Access to comprehensive product and pricing information from Kroger stores.\nAbility to enhance...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Top Grocery Store APIs","url":"https://rapidapi.com/collection/grocery","description":"Many foods and nutrition APIs such as the Edamam API list information that is publicly available, so they offer access at no charge or have a freemium package for applications that make less frequent requests. Because grocery delivery APIs often have private client information, they may not be publicly available or will require a charge for use.\nBest Grocery Store APIs\nThere are many [food and recipe APIs](https://rapidapi.These are used mostly to exchange price and product information with Price Comparison...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Publix API","url":"https://apify.com/ideas/publix-api-79b5363e","description":"Publix API\nBuild an Actor\nStatus\nOpen to develop\nCategories\nAutomation\nE-commerce\nMarketing\nOctober 22, 2025\nAccess Publix supermarket data effortlessly with the Publix API Actor. This tool automates the extraction of product information, pricing, store locations, and availability details from Publix's online platform, transforming it into structured, API-accessible formats.\nKey features\nReal-time price monitoring: Track product prices across multiple store locations....\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Top 10 Grocery Store APIs to Use in 2025","url":"https://datarade.ai/top-lists/best-grocery-store-apis","description":"The API provides real-time access to pricing data from major grocery and retail chains including Walmart, Target, Costco, Kroger, Safeway, Whole Foods, Aldi, and many more. Users can leverage this data to track competitor prices, analyze geographic pricing trends, and optimize their own pricing strategies. With historical data available for up to one year and customizable delivery formats (.bin, .json, .xml, .csv, .xls, .sql, .txt), businesses can gain meaningful insights...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data Scraping API - BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data Insights API","url":"https://www.productdatascrape.com/boothssupermarket-grocery-data-scraping-api.php","description":"BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data Scraping API - BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data Insights API\nLeverage our powerful BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data...\nPricing Insights\nInventory Shift\nConsumer Purchase Trends\nStock Mapping\nDemand Forecasting\nThe BoothsSupermarket Grocery Data Scraping API provides valuable hyperlocal pricing data across various regions. Businesses using Web Scraping BoothsSupermarket APIs can track city-wise pricing variations, identify target markets, and adjust competitive pricing. ","siteName":""},{"title":"supermarket-api","url":"https://github.com/davidlick/supermarket-api","description":"Latest commit\nGit stats\nFiles\nType\nName\ncmd/api\nsupermarket-api\nSupermarket-API is a service providing functionality for cataloging produce and their prices.\nGetting Started\nTo start <beginning of the code>\n supermarket-api\n<end of the code>\nyou will need to create an .env file at <beginning of the code>\n cmd/api/.env\n<tr><th> Method</th><th> Endpoint</th><th>...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"iGrosa API","url":"https://rapidapi.com/Blssngx/api/igrosa-api","description":"iGrosa API\nFree\n0.1 Popularity\n100% Service Level\n513ms Latency\nN/A Test\nAPI Overview\niGrosa API is a groundbreaking solution that revolutionizes the way businesses and developers access grocery prices from multiple supermarkets. iGrosa API streamlines access to extensive product catalogs, ensuring up-to-date pricing information for an enhanced shopping experience. Unlock the power of grocery price intelligence with iGrosa API and gain a competitive...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Best Dmart APIs | Zyla API Hub","url":"https://zylalabs.com/api-marketplace/top-search/Dmart","description":"Mercado Libre Data Fetcher API\nEffortlessly access and retrieve real-time data from Mercado Libre for your applications.\nCommerce & eCommerce\nFree 7-day Trial\nService Level:\n100%\n...\n\nWalmart Data API\nGet price, title, description, images, search products, reviews and ratings and much more inform...\nCommerce & eCommerce\nFree 7-day Trial\nService Level:\n100%\nResponse Time:\n9,066ms","siteName":""},{"title":"Supermarket-connector","url":"https://github.com/Repsay/supermarket-mobile-api-connector/","description":"This api-client allows you to access all data find within the mobile api of the supermarket. This can be used to check prices, promotions or for instance alergies.\nInstalling\nSupermarket-connector is available on PyPI:\npython -m pip install supermarket-connector\nSupermarket-connector is build for python 3.9+.\nCurrent supermarkets connected\nCurrently it is not possible to connect to Lidl supermarket data due to the fact that they do not have a public api...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Grocery Data Scraper API","url":"https://www.scrapingbee.com/scrapers/grocery-data-api/","description":"Scrape price trends\nMonitor real-time grocery store product price changes and trends across competitors and marketplaces, react faster to pricing shifts, discounts, and demand signals.\nTrack expiration dates\nAutomate expiration tracking to prevent spoilage, optimize stock, and reduce waste, enhancing operational efficiency.\nTransparent Grocery...\n\nSTEP 3\nUse your Grocery Data API key to fetch any detail programmatically. We do all the heavy lifting, you get ready-to-use, rendered HTML for parsing and analysis.","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776249870655}}
{"type":"message","id":"bd4dab06","parentId":"006efc02","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:44:31.108Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_kigamimo1it6_2","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"agricultural product price API China market data free 农产品价格 API\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"China NBS: Agricultural Product Price: Rural Market Fair\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ceicdata.com/en/china/nbs-agricultural-product-price-rural-market-fair\",\n      \"description\": \"2003 - 2026 | Monthly | RMB/kg |...\\nThis records an increase from the previous number of 28.520 RMB/kg for Jan 2026. CN: APP: Rural Market Fair: Live Cattle: Medium data is updated monthly, averaging 30.060 RMB/kg from Jan 2013 (Median) to Feb 2026, with 158 observations. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"农产品行情查询API接口介绍及对接-杭州数脉 - 超全API平台 - 幂简集成\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.explinks.com/api/scd20240729464213244451\",\n      \"description\": \"什么是杭州数脉的农产品行情查询?\\n农产品行情查询【杭州数脉】是一款专注于提供农产品市场行情数据的API接口。通过该API，用户可以实时获取各类农产品的价格信息、市场动态和历史数据，帮助用户全面了解农产品市场的变化趋势。该API的数据涵盖了全国各大农产品批发市场，提供了详尽的农产品价格波动情况，旨在为农业生产者、贸易商、研究机构等提供权威、及时的数据支持。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Commodities API: Real-Time Data for Developers and Traders\",\n      \"url\": \"https://financeflowapi.com/commodities-data-api\",\n      \"description\": \"Global Markets: Track commodities from exchanges worldwide with...\\nAgricultural products: wheat, corn, soybeans, coffee, cocoa, rice, tea, sugar, sunflower oil\\nIndex benchmarks: CRB Index, LME Index, GSCI, Nuclear Energy Index, Wind Energy Index\\nAPI Endpoints\\n/commodity-spot - Real-Time Commodity Data\\nRetrieves the latest price of a specific commodity with daily, weekly, monthly, and yearly changes.\\nRequest Example:\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - Commoditic/Agricultural-Commodities-Prices-API: Commoditic Agricultural Commodities Prices API gives you an instant access to real-time and historical prices of various agricultural commoditi\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Commoditic/Agricultural-Commodities-Prices-API\",\n      \"description\": \"Commoditic offers you a list of twenty-one major agricultural commodities: coffee, tea, cocoa, milk, orange juice, wheat, oat, rice, soybeans, corn, cheese, butter, potatoes, palm oil, cannola, sunflower oil, repeseed oil, sugar, wool, rubber and lumber. The historical coverage for agricultural varies as it is dependent...\\nThe agricultural commodity pricing data is available as a JSON REST API, but also as downloadable databases in CSV and Excel files. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"China Agricultural Production Price Index\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ceicdata.com/en/china/agricultural-production-price-index\",\n      \"description\": \"China Agricultural Production Price Index\\nProduction Price Index: AP: Animal Husbandry Product\\n1978 - 2025 | Yearly | Prev Year=100 | National Bureau of Statistics\\nProduction Price Index: AP: Animal Husbandry Product data was reported at 92.500 Prev Year=100 in 2025. Production Price Index: AP: Planting Product\\n1978 - 2025 | Year...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Gold, Oil, And Corn At Your Fingertips Using A Free Commodity Prices API\",\n      \"url\": \"https://commoditypriceapi.com/blog/gold-oil-and-corn-at-your-fingertips-using-a-free-commodity-prices-api\",\n      \"description\": \"CommodityPriceAPI is a REST-based JSON service for commodity pricing. It covers metals, energy, including natural gas, agriculture, and futures in one place. You query prices and receive structured data instantly, making it easy...\\nCorn prices reflect supply health across agricultural commodities. Weather changes, fuel demand, and export levels all play a role. That makes