{"type":"message","id":"a53d3b90","parentId":"2848495a","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:57:25.774Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me update the HEARTBEAT.md to log this proactive work, and also update my memory."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9pk1z52dtf6u_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-15.md << 'EOF'\n\n## 10:47 - 价格检索Skill测试\n\n**任务**：安装并测试ClawHub价格检索相关Skill\n\n**结果**：\n1. price-tracker ✅ 已安装（Mock数据模式）\n2. price-monitor ⏳ ClawHub限速，未完成\n3. browser工具访问Amazon ✅ 成功获取真实价格数据\n\n**关键发现**：\n- ClawHub有API限速（30次/分钟）\n- 已安装skill使用Mock数据，需要接入真实API\n- browser工具可以访问Amazon但不稳定（Chrome断连）\n\n**输出**：\n- 体验报告已上传飞书文档\n- 项目进度表已更新\n- Skill文件已保存到workspace\n\n**结论**：最可靠方案仍是1688官方API\nEOF\necho \"已更新\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776250639808,"responseId":"062ea20ff3e91cb8651b51eb099c38be"}}
