{"type":"message","id":"7d1bcc71","parentId":"d1552b87","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:57:33.122Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should summarize what was accomplished for the user."},{"type":"text","text":"## ✅ 价格检索Skill测试完成！\n\n### 📊 测试结果汇总\n\n| 测试项 | 状态 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| **price-tracker** | ✅ 已安装 | Mock数据模式可用，需接真实API |\n| **price-monitor** | ⏳ 限速 | ClawHub API限速，未完成 |\n| **Browser获取Amazon价格** | ✅ 成功 | 真实数据：Sony WH-1000XM5 ¥1,426~¥1,688 |\n\n---\n\n### 📝 体验报告已上传飞书\n\n**文档标题**：「🛒 价格检索工具体验报告 - ClawHub Skill测试」\n\n**报告包含**：\n- price-tracker详细体验\n- Mock数据测试结果\n- Browser+Amazon真实价格获取\n- 第三方工具调研\n- 德胧采购比价系统建议路径\n\n---\n\n### 🔑 核心结论\n\n**最可靠方案**：仍是1688官方API\n- 免费（申请后5分钟生效）\n- 真实数据\n- 稳定可靠\n\n**Browser方案**：可以作为补充\n- 优点：可访问任何网站\n- 缺点：不稳定、需要处理反爬虫\n\n---\n\n### 📁 已保存的文件\n\n- `skills/price-tracker/` - 价格追踪Skill\n- `skills/price-monitor/` - 价格监控Skill（部分）\n- `skills/1688-api-key-guide/` - 1688 Key申请指南\n- `skills/1688-product-research/` - 1688选品调研指南\n\n---\n\n**下一步**：等待1688账号注册完成后，申请官方API Key即可获取真实批发价数据！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776250645900,"responseId":"062ea2158370d77fbf0dd2616d6fedff"}}
