{"type":"message","id":"5e443d7d","parentId":"b5919624","timestamp":"2026-04-15T22:17:20.815Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is pointing out that the hotel procurement price tool I promised to develop for their birthday wasn't included in the scheduled review/daily summary. They're concerned it will be forgotten.\n\nLet me check my memory and scheduled tasks to see if I missed something important. They mentioned \"生日请你帮忙开发的酒店采购价格的相关工具\" - which seems to be a hotel procurement price tool I promised to develop on their birthday (April 15th).\n\nLet me check:\n1. Today's date is April 15, 2026\n2. The user mentioned \"birthday\" - but wait, today IS April 15, so maybe today IS their birthday and I promised something?\n\nActually, looking at the context, the user said \"生日请你帮忙开发的\" - this sounds like \"on your birthday, please help develop...\" \n\nWait, I think the user is saying: \"For my birthday, I asked you to help develop a hotel procurement price related tool, but I see you didn't include it in the scheduled review. It will be forgotten.\"\n\nThis is concerning - if I promised to develop something on their birthday and it's not being tracked, I need to:\n1. Acknowledge this oversight\n2. Check my memory for what was promised\n3. Make sure it's properly tracked\n\nLet me check my memory files for any birthday-related promises or procurement tool discussions."},{"type":"text","text":"您说得对！我来检查一下记忆，看看是否遗漏了您的生日承诺：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vjfwjfu9tnpu_1","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"生日 酒店采购价格工具 承诺"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vjfwjfu9tnpu_2","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"1688 采购比价系统 承诺"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp"