{"type":"compaction","id":"b10a8191","parentId":"f32d178e","timestamp":"2026-04-16T00:33:39.157Z","summary":"<think>\nThe user wants me to summarize this conversation into a structured context checkpoint. Let me analyze the conversation and create a comprehensive summary.\n\nKey points from the conversation:\n1. The user (晁留柱) is working on a procurement price comparison system for Delong Group (德胧集团), specifically for Tianjin Ruiwan Kaiyuan Mingdu Hotel (天津瑞湾开元名都酒店)\n2. They want to automate the process of applying for 1688 API keys\n3. Browser debugging was successful - Chrome can be started with specific parameters\n4. A \"1688 API Key Application Guide\" skill was created\n5. A \"1688 Product Research\" skill was created\n6. Two sub-agents were spawned: browser-debug (successful) and 1688-api (successful)\n7. Search results were obtained for hotel Bluetooth door locks (艾迪尔 and 杨格 brands), mineral water, tissues, and drinks\n8. The user provided their phone number: 13820945137\n9. Employee roster was retrieved from Feishu shared pool\n10. 1688 registration process discussed - requires phone verification, Alipay/bank account verification\n\nKey files created:\n- /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/1688-api-key-guide/SKILL.md\n- /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/1688-product-research/SKILL.md\n- /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/1688_API_GUIDE.md\n- /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/scripts/1688_search.py\n- /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/data/tianjin-ruiwan-hotel-license.md\n- /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/data/tianjin-ruiwan-employee-roster.md\n\n\n- Several Feishu bitables were referenced or modified during the workflow process.\n</think>\n\n## Goal\n帮德胧集团建立采购比价系统，需要从1688获取酒店物资批发价格数据。核心任务：\n1. 自动化1688 API Key申请流程\n2. 获取酒店蓝牙门锁（艾迪尔、杨格）、矿泉水、抽纸、饮料等品类的批发价格\n3. 将调研能力沉淀为可复用的Skill\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 使用天津瑞湾开元名都酒店的营业执照注册1688账号，而非德胧集团\n- 法定代表人确认是李东林（用户确认，营业执照照片显示傅全勇是旧执照）\n- 飞书手机号可见但API不返回实际号码，用户直接提供了13820945137\n- 浏览器方案和API方案采