d to OpenClaw\n\n## Critical Context\n- OpenClaw appears to be a product with chat/messaging functionality\n- Previous version had no memory/persistence of user preferences\n\n\n- New update addresses memory retention issue\n\nI'll focus on the specific identifiers and language context. The key details include:\n- Message ID: om_x100b52cd2aff14a8b3430ef4f21f7f3\n- User ID: ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\n- User Name: 晁留柱\n- Timestamp: 2026-04-15 13:44 UTC\n- Message: \"读取内容\"\n\nThe communication appears straightforward - a user initiating a conversation about an OpenClaw update, with a simple request to read content. No complex interaction or specific task is evident from the current context.\n\nThe core issue involves OpenClaw's previous limitations with user preference memory. Previously, interacting with the platform felt like starting from scratch each conversation, requiring repeated self-introductions. The new update seems designed to address this memory persistence challenge.\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- message_id: om_x100b52cd2aff14a8b3430ef4f21f7f3\n- sender_id: ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\n- sender_name: 晁留柱\n- replied_message_id: om_x100b52ccd537b8b8b21ea758cb0d849\n</think>\n\n## Goal\n- 用户分享/请求读取关于 OpenClaw 产品更新的内容\n- 讨论 OpenClaw 新增记忆/持久化偏好功能\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- (none)\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 收到用户发送的 OpenClaw 更新卡片消息\n- [x] 消息包含被回复的上一条消息（om_x100b52ccd537b8b8b21ea758cb0d849）\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] 等待明确的任务指示或问题\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- (无 - 处于对话初始阶段)\n\n## Next Steps\n1. 确认用户具体需要什么帮助\n2. 可能需要解释或讨论 OpenClaw 的记忆功能\n\n## Critical Context\n- OpenClaw 之前版本缺乏记忆功能，每次对话需重新自我介绍\n- 新版本更新解决了\"失忆\"问题，支持记住用户偏好\n- 消息来自飞书（Feishu）平台私信\n\n## Decisions\n- (无决策已做出)\n\n## Open TODOs\n- (待用户明确需求)\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- (无)\n\n## Pending user asks\n- 用户仅发送\"读取内容\"，具体请求待确认\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- message_id: om_x100b52cd2aff14a8b3430ef4f21f7f3\n- sender_id: ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\n- sender_name: 晁留柱\n- reply_to_message_id: om_x100b52ccd537b8b8b21ea758cb0d849\n- timestamp: Wed 2026-04-15 13:44 UTC\n- platform: Feishu[default] DM\n\n## Recent turns preserved verbatim\n- Assistant: 我没有看到新的公众号文章图片附件。您是指：\n\n1. **转发文章链接**给我？（粘贴公众号文章的链接）\n2. 还是**截图**发给我？\n\n---\n\n如果是公众号文章链接，我可以：\n- 抓取文章内容\n- 提取关键信息\n- 帮您总结新功能\n\n**请把文章链接发给我！** 🦞\n[non-text content: thinking]","firstKeptEntryId":"77985627","tokensBefore":0,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":true}
{"type":"message","id":"da13614b","parentId":"7e209816","timestamp":"2026-04-16T00:46:56.718Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-16 00:46:35 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b5137586f60a4b32d6df50a68001]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5137586f60a4b32d6df50a68001\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-16 00:46 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n不用等小L了，立即进行吧，先跑一个能用的版本出来，我看到另外一个AI伙伴解锁到了京东和淘宝有开放的Api访问方式，而且可以以个人账户去申请这个请你去跟据研究一下"}],"timestamp":1776300416667}}
