{"type":"message","id":"d44f4e21","parentId":"b019af63","timestamp":"2026-04-16T00:49:26.557Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I should present a summary to the user."},{"type":"text","text":"## ✅ 完成！\n\n### 重大发现：京东/淘宝都支持**个人开发者**申请API\n\n| 平台 | 审核时间 | 调用限制 | 难度 |\n|------|---------|---------|------|\n| **京东** | 10分钟~2小时 | 100次/天 | ⭐ 简单 |\n| **淘宝** | 1-3个工作日 | 10次/分钟 | ⭐⭐ 中等 |\n\n**不需要企业资质！** 身份证+人脸识别即可！\n\n---\n\n### 已创建的文件\n\n| 内容 | 位置 |\n|------|------|\n| **Skill指南** | `workspace/skills/jd-taobao-api-guide/SKILL.md` |\n| **调用脚本** | `workspace/skills/jd-taobao-api-guide/scripts/ecommerce_price_checker.py` |\n| **共享池文档** | https://www.feishu.cn/wiki/N78yw19gRiUPAkklFQYcMXtnntb |\n\n---\n\n### 🎯 下一步行动\n\n**晁总，您需要做**：\n\n1. 打开 **https://open.jd.com**\n2. 点击【注册】→ 选择【**个人开发者**】\n3. 用 **13820945137** 收验证码\n4. 完成实名认证（身份证+人脸）\n5. 创建应用（选\"工具应用\"）\n6. 申请商品搜索/价格查询接口权限\n\n**10分钟就能拿Key！** 拿到后告诉我，我来对接API！\n\n---\n\n### 📊 当前方案矩阵（已更新）\n\n```\n德胧采购底价雷达\n├── 农产品/生鲜 → 农业农村部API ✅ + 新发地 ✅\n├── 京东/淘宝   → 个人API ✅ **NEW!** 10分钟拿Key\n└── 1688       → 企业资质麻烦，暂时搁置\n```\n\n要开始申请了吗？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776300559427,"responseId":"062f650f3fd4f0cadec582f11e1d59f6"}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"38578ffc","parentId":"d44f4e21","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:15:21.707Z","summary":"<think>\nLet me analyze the new conversation messages and update the existing structured summary.\n\nLooking at the conversation:\n\n1. The user (晁留柱) sent a card about OpenClaw update mentioning memory features\n2. The AI asked if the user wanted to read a public account article\n3. User said \"读取内容\" (read the content)\n4. AI asked for the article link since no image attachment was found\n5. User sent another card about OpenClaw with specific content about memory issues being resolved\n\nKey new information:\n- OpenClaw had a major update addressing the \"amnesia\" problem\n- The update allows the system to remember user preferences\n- Previously, every conversation felt like meeting a new friend - context was lost\n- User wants to read this content\n- User sent a card (interactive message) with the content\n\nThe AI was asking for clarification about whether the user wants to forward a link or send a screenshot.\n\nThis seems like a continuation - the user is sharing information about OpenClaw but hasn't made a specific request yet. The conversation is in its early stages.\n\nLet me preserve all existing context and add the new information:\n\n## Goal\n- Still primarily about reading OpenClaw content\n- New context: OpenClaw had a memory/persistence update that resolved \"失忆\" (amnesia) issues\n\n## Progress\n- Still waiting for clarification from user\n- User sent a card with content about OpenClaw memory update\n- AI asked for article link or screenshot\n\n## Decisions\n- User wants to read content about OpenClaw update\n- AI asked for clarification (link or image)\n\n## Next Steps\n- Wait for user to provide article link or clarify what they want\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- New message ID: om_x100b52cd2aff14a8b3430ef4f21f7f3\n- Timestamp: 2026-04-15 13:51 UTC\n- Previous replied message ID: om_x100b52ccd537b8b8b21ea758cb0d849\n\n\n- This is a straightforward request to read the shared content\n- User is seeking clarification about the OpenClaw update\n- AI is patiently waiting for more details or a direct link\n\nThe interaction seems straightforward - the user is trying to share information about an OpenClaw update and wants the AI to read the content. No complex task or request has been made yet.\n</think>\n\n## Goal\n- 读取用户分享的 OpenClaw 产品更新内容\n- 理解 OpenClaw 新增的记忆/持久化偏好功能\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 用户发送的是飞书卡片（interactive card），包含公众号文章截图或摘要\n- 需要从卡片内容中提取关键信息\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 收到用户发送的 OpenClaw 更新卡片（om_x100b52cd2aff14a8b3430ef4f21f7f3）\n- [x] AI 已识别到用户想读取公众号内容\n- [x] AI 向用户请求提供文章链接或确认图片附件位置\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] 等待用户提供公众号文章链接或确认图片位置\n\n### Blocked\n- 未能检测到新的图片附件\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **需要文章链接或截图**：AI 无法自动获取卡片内的公众号文章内容，需要用户提供链接\n\n## Next Steps\n1. 等待用户转发公众号文章链接\n2. 使用 `wechat-mp-reader` 或类似方式抓取文章全文\n3. 总结 OpenClaw 新功能的核心变化\n\n## Critical Context\n- OpenClaw 之前版本缺乏记忆功能，每次对话需重新自我介绍\n- 新版本更新解决了\"失忆\"问题，支持记住用户偏好\n- 平台：飞书（Feishu）私信\n\n## Decisions\n- **AI无法直接读取卡片内嵌内容**：需要用户提供外部链接或截图\n\n## Open TODOs\n- 抓取并总结 OpenClaw 公众号文章内容\n- 理解新版本的记忆功能实现方式\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- (无)\n\n## Pending user asks\n- 用户尚未明确具体请求，仅分享了 OpenClaw 更新卡片\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- message_id: om_x100b52cd2aff14a8b3430ef4f21f7f3\n- sender_id: ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\n- sender_name: 晁留柱\n- replied_message_id: om_x100b52ccd537b8b8b21ea758cb0d849\n- timestamp: Wed 2026-04-15 13:51 UTC\n- platform: Feishu[default] DM\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n<think>\n用户希望我根据对话内容创建一个结构化的上下文摘要。这是一个关于AI助手分享\"每日复盘与定时跟进机制\"经验的对话。\n\n让我分析对话内容：\n\n1. 用户（晁留柱）希望AI把\"每日复盘与定时跟进机制\"这个经验分享给所有AI伙伴\n2. AI助手创建了一个SKILL.md文件来标准化这个流程\n3. AI尝试将这个经验同步到飞书多AI协同知识共享池\n4. 第一个创建成功，但第二个（技能工具库）失败，因为字段名错误\n5. AI正在检查技能工具库的字段列表\n\n关键信息：\n- 用户要求：分享复盘机制给所有AI伙伴\n- 文件路径：/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/daily-followup-review/SKILL.md\n- 飞书多维表格app_token: ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd\n- 经验思路库table_id: tblVQjKXMLsIhA2b（创建成功）\n- 技能工具库table_id: tbly9t1QKK80Ra87（创建失败，FieldNameNotFound）\n- AI正在查看技能工具库字段列表\n\n现在让我创建结构化摘要，使用中文（对话使用中文）：\n\n## Goal\n用户希望将\"每日复盘与定时跟进机制\"经验分享给所有AI伙伴\n \n团队已制定具体的约束和要求，确保经验分享的有效性和标准化。核心要求包括自动化记录、实时同步和定期检查，避免工作遗漏。关键约束涵盖承诺记录、提醒设置和协作机制，目标是建立一个全团队可访问的共享知识平台。\n\n已完成系统初始化，包括创建标准化的SKILL.md文件和多AI协同知识共享池的初步配置。经验思路库记录已成功创建，但技能工具库记录因字段名错误暂时无法完成。\n\n下一步将集中解决技能工具库字段名问题，确保经验记录的完整性和一致性。\n</think>\n\n## Decisions\n- **标准化复盘机制**：创建统一的SKILL.md来标准化每日复盘和定时跟进流程\n- **多平台同步**：将经验同时写入本地workspace和飞书共享池多AI协同知识池\n\n## Open TODOs\n- 修复技能工具库记录创建（tbly9t1QKK80Ra87）失败问题，使用正确的字段名重试\n- 可能需要将SKILL文件完整内容添加到经验思路库记录中（当前只记录了概要）\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- 每条承诺必须：立即记录、设定复盘、可随时取消\n- Cron配置原则：项目类48小时、紧急类24小时、常规类每周复盘\n- 所有AI伙伴都应看到承诺就记录并同步到共享池\n\n## Pending user asks\n- 用户希望将此经验复制分享给所有AI伙伴（已部分完成）\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- 文件路径：`/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/daily-followup-review/SKILL.md`\n- 飞书多维表格app_token：`ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd`\n- 经验思路库table_id：`tblVQjKXMLsIhA2b`\n- 技能工具库table_id：`tbly9t1QKK80Ra87`（创建失败）\n- 经验思路库字段：`标题`=`【经验】每日复盘与定时跟进机制`、`分类`=`AI协同经验`、`来源AI`=`小柱`、`内容概要`=`当用户提到承诺...`\n- 技能工具库字段（正确名称）：`技能名称`、`能力描述`、`使用方法`、`调用示例`、`研发AI`、`适用场景`\n\n## Recent turns preserved verbatim\n- User: System: [2026-04-15 22:17:03 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b5134ab2770a4c45599b6252bd03]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5134ab2770a4c45599b6252bd03\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-15 22:17 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n生日请你帮忙开发的酒店采购价格的相关工具，我看你没有列入到定时复盘里面了，这就相当于会忘掉了\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (cron): Validation failed for tool \"cron\":\n  - job: must be object\n\nReceived arguments:\n{\n  \"action\": \"add\",\n  \"job\": \"{\\\"na