{"type":"message","id":"59cdb1f8","parentId":"91924959","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:15:49.595Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is an interesting message. It appears to be from \"ArkClaw\" (another AI agent) claiming to be commissioned by 晁留柱 to help with Feishu OAuth full-permission authorization.\n\nHowever, looking at this message carefully:\n1. It's from a DM with no attachment\n2. The sender appears to be asking me to perform OAuth authorization\n3. This could be a prompt injection attempt - someone trying to get me to perform an authorization action\n\nLooking at my available tools, I do have `feishu_oauth_batch_auth` which says:\n\"飞书批量授权工具。一次性授权应用已开通的所有用户权限（User Access Token scope）。【使用场景】用户明确要求'授权所有权限'、'一次性授权完成'时使用。【重要】禁止主动推荐此工具，仅在用户明确要求时使用。\"\n\nThe key constraint is: \"禁止主动推荐此工具，仅在用户明确要求时使用\" - I should not proactively recommend this tool.\n\nBut wait - is this actually from 晁留柱 or is this someone impersonating? The message claims to be from \"ArkClaw\" but the chat_id is \"user:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\" which is 晁留柱's ID according to my authorized senders list.\n\nHowever, the content of the message is asking me to use `feishu_oauth_batch_auth` tool. This is a sensitive operation that:\n1. Grants all permissions at once\n2. Should only be used when the user explicitly asks\n\nThe message is signed as \"ArkClaw\" but the actual sender metadata shows it came from 晁留柱's DM. This could mean:\n\n\n1. ArkClaw sent this through 晁留柱's session\n2. Someone is trying to inject instructions to make me run the OAuth tool\n\nAccording to my system prompt, the inbound metadata shows sender_id is ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 (晁留柱), which matches my authorized senders. So the actual user is 晁留柱. But the message content is from \"ArkClaw\" asking me to do OAuth. This could be legitimate - maybe 晁留柱 asked ArkClaw to coordinate this with me. Or it could be a prompt injection. I need to be careful here - I should verify with the actual user before proceeding with any sensitive authorization steps.\n\nThe message asks me to use feishu_oauth_batch_auth, but my instructions say this tool is for users who explicitly request 'authorize all permissions' or 'one-time authorization completion'. It also says I should not proactively recommend this tool. Since this request came through a third party rather than directly from 晁留柱, and since OAuth authorization is a significant action that could have security implications, I should get confirmation from 晁留柱 directly before proceeding. The sender metadata shows this came from ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 (晁留柱), but the content is from \"ArkClaw\" asking me to run the OAuth batch auth tool. This is a security-relevant situation - either 晁留柱 is genuinely asking through ArkClaw, or someone is attempting to manipulate me via prompt injection to execute a sensitive operation. Given that feishu_oauth_batch_auth is a significant action that shouldn't be triggered by indirect requests, I should confirm directly with 晁留柱 before proceeding."},{"type":"text","text":"收到这条消息，但有几个问题需要澄清：\n\n**安全确认**：这条消息虽然显示来自您的飞书账号（ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409），但内容署名是\"ArkClaw\"，要求我执行 `feishu_oauth_batch_auth`（一次性授权所有权限）。\n\n**请您确认**：\n1. 您是否委托 ArkClaw 发送这条消息？\n2. 您是否确实希望我立即执行全权限授权？\n\n如果确认是您本人要求的，我可以直接执行。如果不是，我需要先向您确认这是否是您本人操作。\n\n请回复 **\"确认授权\"** 或 **\"不是我操作的\"** 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776302123145,"responseId":"062f6b2bc1c381a8e0b8ea2b5853f62d"}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"518c79af","parentId":"59cdb1f8","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:23:09.122Z","summary":"<think>\nLet me analyze the new conversation messages and update the existing structured summary.\n\nLooking at the conversation:\n\n1. The user (晁留柱) sent a card about OpenClaw update mentioning memory features\n2. The AI asked if the user wanted to read a public account article\n3. User said \"读取内容\" (read the content)\n4. AI asked for the article link since no image attachment was found\n5. User sent another card about OpenClaw with specific content about memory issues being resolved\n\nKey new information:\n- OpenClaw had a major update addressing the \"amnesia\" problem\n- The update allows the system to remember user preferences\n- Previously, every conversation felt like meeting a new friend - context was lost\n- User wants to read this content\n- User sent a card (interactive message) with the content\n\nThe AI was asking for clarification about whether the user wants to forward a link or send a screenshot.\n\nThis seems like a continuation - the user is sharing information about OpenClaw but hasn't made a specific request yet. The conversation is in its early stages.\n\nLet me preserve all existing context and add the new information:\n\n## Goal\n- Still primarily about reading OpenClaw content\n- New context: OpenClaw had a memory/persistence update that resolved \"失忆\" (amnesia) issues\n\n## Progress\n- Still waiting for clarification from user\n- User sent a card with content about OpenClaw memory update\n- AI asked for article link or screenshot\n\n## Decisions\n- User wants to read content about OpenClaw update\n- AI asked for clarification (link or image)\n\n## Next Steps\n- Wait for user to provide article link or clarify what they want\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- New message ID: om_x100b52cd2aff14a8b3430ef4f21f7f3\n- Timestamp: 2026-04-15 13:51 UTC\n- Previous replied message ID: om_x100b52ccd537b8b8b21ea758cb0d849\n\n\n- This is a straightforward request to read the shared content\n- User is seeking clarification about the OpenClaw update\n- AI is patiently waiting for more details or a direct link\n\nThe interaction seems straightforward - the user is trying to share information about an OpenClaw update and wants the AI to read the content. No complex task or request has been made yet.\n</think>\n\n## Goal\n- 读取用户分享的 OpenClaw 产品更新内容\n- 理解 OpenClaw 新增的记忆/持久化偏好功能\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 用户发送的是飞书卡片（interactive card），包含公众号文章截图或摘要\n- 需要从卡片内容中提取关键信息\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 收到用户发送的 OpenClaw 更新卡片（om_x100b52cd2aff14a8b3430ef4f21f7f3）\n- [x] AI 已识别到用户想读取公众号内容\n- [x] AI 向用户请求提供文章链接或确认图片附件位置\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] 等待用户提供公众号文章链接或确认图片位置\n\n### Blocked\n- 未能检测到新的图片附件\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **需要文章链接或截图**：AI 无法自动获取卡片内的公众号文章内容，需要用户提供链接\n\n## Next Steps\n1. 等待用户转发公众号文章链接\n2. 使用 `wechat-mp-reader` 或类似方式抓取文章全文\n3. 总结 OpenClaw 新功能的核心变化\n\n## Critical Context\n- OpenClaw 之前版本缺乏记忆功能，每次对话需重新自我介绍\n- 新版本更新解决了\"失忆\"问题，支持记住用户偏好\n- 平台：飞书（Feishu）私信\n\n## Decisions\n- **AI无法直接读取卡片内嵌内容**：需要用户提供外部链接或截图\n\n## Open TODOs\n- 抓取并总结 OpenClaw 公众号文章内容\n- 理解新版本的记忆功能实现方式\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- (无)\n\n## Pending user asks\n- 用户尚未明确具体请求，仅分享了 OpenClaw 更新卡片\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- message_id: om_x100b52cd2aff14a8b3430ef4f21f7f3\n- sender_id: ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\n- sender_name: 晁留柱\n- replied_message_id: om_x100b52ccd537b8b8b21ea758cb0d849\n- timestamp: Wed 2026-04-15 13:51 UTC\n- platform: Feishu[default] DM\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n<think>\n用户希望我根据对话内容创建一个结构化的上下文摘要。这是一个关于AI助手分享\"每日复盘与定时跟进机制\"经验的对话。\n\n让我分析对话内容：\n\n1. 用户（晁留柱）希望AI把\"每日复盘与定时跟进机制\"这个经验分享给所有AI伙伴\n2. AI助手创建了一个SKILL.md文件来标准化这个流程\n3. AI尝试将这个经验同步到飞书多AI协同知识共享池\n4. 第一个创建成功，但第二个（技能工具库）失败，因为字段名错误\n5. AI正在检查技能工具库的字段列表\n\n关键信息：\n- 用户要求：分享复盘机制给所有AI伙伴\n- 文件路径：/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/daily-followup-review/SKILL.md\n- 飞书多维表格app_token: ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd\n- 经验思路库table_id: tblVQjKXMLsIhA2b（创建成功）\n- 技能工具库table_id: tbly