{"type":"message","id":"36a00ff6","parentId":"08d6fdd1","timestamp":"2026-04-16T03:55:24.634Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user has two questions:\n\n1. First - they want to evaluate whether NotebookLM CLI has practical value for Delonix, like:\n   - Quality improvement of generated reports\n   - Does it need a separate NotebookLM account or API?\n\n2. Second - JD registration also requires enterprise identity and they're confused about what information to enter\n\nLet me address both:\n\n**For NotebookLM:**\n- I should research what NotebookLM CLI can actually do\n- Check if it needs a separate account/API\n- Evaluate its usefulness for hotel procurement reporting\n\n**For JD:**\n- The user says JD also requires enterprise identity - this might be a misunderstanding. Let me check the actual JD registration requirements again.\n- According to my earlier research, JD DOES support personal developers with just ID + face recognition\n- Maybe the user encountered a Chinese interface that was confusing\n- I should provide clearer step-by-step guidance\n\nLet me do some research on both topics."},{"type":"text","text":"好问题！让我分别调研一下：\n\n## 一、NotebookLM CLI 评估\n\n先查一下它的实际能力：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zgh2c9wy8fq7_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"NotebookLM CLI API account free usage limits 2024"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776311713117,"responseId":"062f90a14685372f0bcc680bb8b13c9a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b9e10947","parentId":"36a00ff6","timestamp":"2026-04-16T03:55:26.760Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_zgh2c9wy8fq7_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"NotebookLM CLI API account free usage limits 2024\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"notebooklm-mcp-cli 0.5.0\",\n      \"url\": \"https://pypi.org/project/notebooklm-mcp-cli/0.5.0/\",\n      \"description\": \"notebook lm - mcp - cli 0.5.0 pip install notebook lm - mcp - cli = = 0 . 5 . 0 released : mar 19 , 2026 unified cli and mcp server for google notebook lm ...\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"NotebookLM\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.theneuron.ai/tools/notebooklm\",\n      \"description\": \"Supported sources: Google Docs, Google Slides, PDFs, text/Markdown, web URLs, YouTube URLs (public), audio files, and pasted text.\\nSource limits: Up to 50 sources per notebook; each source up to 500,...\\nAccount limits (free): ~100 notebooks, 50 sources/notebook, 50 daily chat queries, 3 audio and 3 video generations per day; Plus/Pro raises these (see Pricing).\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Limits for Free Users of NotebookLM - Genspark\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.genspark.ai/spark/limits-for-free-users-of-notebooklm/7be8213f-5f92-45b9-a58c-e5ccac846e57\",\n      \"description\": \"<table>\\n<tr><th>Feature</th><th>Free Users Limit</th></tr>\\n<tr><td>Notebooks</td><td>Up to 100</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>Sources per Notebook</td><td>Up to 50</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>Queries per Notebook</td><td>Up to 50</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>Audio Overviews</td...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"NotebookLMのフリープランでのノートブック上限とその対応方法 - Genspark\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.genspark.ai/spark/notebooklm%E3%81%AE%E3%83%95%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%97%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%81%A7%E3%81%AE%E3%83%8E%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%83%96%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%E3%81%A8%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E5%AF%BE%E5%BF%9C%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/692f9e4d-db9e-41d9-bb37-62fa2d7c88ca\",\n      \"description\": \"1ノートブックあたりのソースの上限: 最大50のソース を登録可能。\\n言語上限: 各ソースの上限は50...\\nソース制限: 1ノートブックあたり最大50のソース。\\n1ソースの語数上限: 500,000語。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"NotebookLM無料版の制限を徹底解説｜ファイル数・容量の上限\",\n      \"url\": \"https://re-birth-ai.com/notebooklm%E7%84%A1%E6%96%99%E7%89%88%E3%81%AE%E5%88%B6%E9%99%90%E3%82%92%E5%BE%B9%E5%BA%95%E8%A7%A3%E8%AA%AC%EF%BD%9C%E3%83%95%E3%82%A1%E3%82%A4%E3%83%AB%E6%95%B0%E3%83%BB%E5%AE%B9%E9%87%8F%E3%81%AE/\",\n      \"description\": \"NotebookLMの無料版では、1つのGoogleアカウントにつき最大100個のプロジェクトを作成することができます。\\n各プロジェクトは独立した作業空間として機能するため、以下のような用途別にプロジェクトを分けることが可能です：\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"NotebookLM\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.bosala.ai/tools/1033\",\n      \"description\": \"Each notebook can hold up to 50 sources (like PDFs, links, Google Docs, etc.)\\nIncludes a voice assistant that gives audio overviews (up to 3 per day, free)\\nYou can ask...\\nThe free plan includes up to 100 notebooks, each supporting 50 sources (such as PDFs, Google Docs, web links, or transcripts) with a limit of 500,000 words or 200MB per notebook. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"【NotebookLM 使用教程】NotebookLM 入门:知识工作者的外挂常超详细教程 教你入门NotebookLM(总览+案例+进阶)_人工智能_懿轩HQ-AtomGit开源社区\",\n      \"url\": \"https://gitcode.csdn.net/69be5d3b0a2f6a37c5992d37.html\",\n      \"description\": \"如果你在中国大陆使用，需要先解决网络访问问题。\\n关于价格：\\nNotebookLM 基础功能完全免费，但在高算力功能上（如生成幻灯片 Slide Deck、长音频 Deep Dive）有严格的每日配额。\\n免费版通常每天仅支持约 3 次音频生成；...\\n局限5：免费版有使用限制\\n目前个人用户免费，但企业/教育账户可能需要管理员开权限。另外18岁以下用户有访问限制。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"NotebookLM Plus Launches : Unlock Premium AI Tools & 3 Key Features\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.geeky-gadgets.com/notebooklm-plus-premium-features/\",\n      \"description\": \"A new feature enables converting saved notes into reusable sources, streamlining tasks like reports, research, and templates.\\nNotebookLM Plus, a premium subscription tier, offers expanded limits, advanced privacy settings, chat customization, and analytics for organizations and...\\nThe free version of NotebookLM remains a robust option for casual and moderate users, though it now includes updated usage limits:\\n100 notebooks.\\n50 sources per notebook.\\n50 daily chat queries.\\n3 daily audio generations.\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"NotebookLM\",\n      \"url\": \"https://zelili.com/tools/notebooklm/\",\n      \"description\": \"Is NotebookLM free to use?\\nYes, NotebookLM is completely free with a Google account; no paid tiers or credit limits (only source caps: 50 per notebook, ...\\nHow many sources can I add to a NotebookLM notebook?\\nUp to 50 sources per notebook (PDFs, Docs, URLs, text), with a total limit of around 500,000 words across all sources.\\nCan NotebookLM answer questions outside my uploaded sources?\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"NotebookLM | Columbia University Information Technology\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cuit.columbia.edu/content/notebooklm\",\n      \"description\": \"NotebookLM is now available to the Columbia University community. This AI-powered research and note-taking assistant helps you organize, summarize, and synthesize information from your own documents and trusted sources.\\nNotebookLM is an advanced generative AI tool available for faculty and...\\nFree\\nFree\\nUp to 100 notebooks, each with up to 50 sources (up to 500K words each), and daily limits of 50 chat queries\\nFree\\nFree\\n3/day\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"NotebookLM CLI API account free usage limits 2024","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"notebooklm-mcp-cli 0.5.0","url":"https://pypi.org/project/notebooklm-mc